+(** Two further detachments give S by reusing the existing prefix schemas.
+    This replaces the former five-detachment exchange extension. *)
+Theorem basisS a b c :
+    T (wim (wim a (wim b c)) (wim (wim a b) (wim a c))).
+Proof.
+ exact (dmp h _ _
+   (dmp h _ _
+     (d34 (wim b c) c (wim a (wim b c)) (wim (wim a b) (wim a c)))
+     (d57 (wim b c) c a (wim a b)))
+   (d55 b c a)).
+Qed.
+End Derivation.
